        <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-plum-950">Experience 1.0</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-600">Theme: <em>This Thing Called Love</em>. Over 100 attendees joined for vulnerability & healing.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-warm-300 space-y-3 shadow-xs">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase text-plum-600 bg-plum-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">October 2025</span>
